## More than “this is the right play”

::: {.bms-section-lead}
Engines, books, and strong players can tell you what to do. The harder part is understanding why.
:::

::: {.bms-story}
I started this project while trying to understand one of my own blunders. The engine gave me a number. A friend who is a great player said, “Eventually, you’ll see it.”

I wanted to know what I was supposed to see.
:::

